er. Her husband is a workaholic with poor communication skills."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is worried that her son Yuuki and his father are at odds with each other. In addition, she is concerned because she realizes that her son, who is about to take an entrance examination, is conscious of her as a woman."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Is not the real mother of protagonist. She stole her sister's lover and got married."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c66635"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の母親。専業主婦。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格は温厚で優しいが、押しに弱く、流されやすい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"専業主婦で、夫は家庭を顧みない仕事人間で、夫婦間でのコミュニケーションは不全。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"息子と父親が仲違いしていることに心を痛めながら、その息子が自分を女性として意識し始めていることに戸惑いと不安を感じている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18954","sourceWorkId":"10264","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"37歳、主婦"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"押しに弱く温厚な専業主婦の母親。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"夫は仕事人間でコミュニケート不全。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"息子の祐樹と父親が仲たがいしていることを気に病む。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"加えて受験を間近に控えた息子が自分を女性として意識していることに気づき憂鬱な日々を過ごしている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"199587"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"年龄（本版本）","value":"37 岁","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18954","sourceWorkId":"10264","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"105 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18954","sourceWorkId":"10264","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"158 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18954","sourceWorkId":"10264","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"88 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18954","sourceWorkId":"10264","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"56 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18954","sourceWorkId":"10264","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts"